    "made-locally": {
      "type": "or-text-section",
      "settings": {
        "mark_size": 0,
        "eyebrow": "<p>moonbae ©2026<br/>Drawn at night. Printed in India.</p>",
        "left_label": "moonbae",
        "right_label": "India",
        "text": "<p>Every graphic starts as a real drawing from a real hand, and it goes on the shirt looking like it. Printed in India after you order — nothing warehoused, nothing watered down. If it feels like a bit much, good. It was never meant to feel safe.</p>",
